{"id":"6f4ac354-b135-419b-b673-6170ee2d8cd1","createdAt":"2026-10-26T13:37:46.556Z","batchId":"pricing_claude-opus-5-5_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-opus-5-5","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Pricing</span>\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">Simple plans that grow with your work</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Start free and upgrade when you need more projects, storage or collaborators. Every plan includes unlimited notes and real-time sync.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm center\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Billing period\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" id=\"bill-monthly\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Monthly</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" id=\"bill-yearly\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Yearly <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Save 20%</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between row\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Free</h2><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">For individuals</span></div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Everything you need to organise personal projects.</p>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-value\">$0</span> <span class=\"muted small\">/ forever</span></div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"#signup-free\">Get started free</a>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">No credit card required.</p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n        <li>✓ Up to 3 projects</li>\n        <li>✓ 2 GB file storage</li>\n        <li>✓ Unlimited notes &amp; tasks</li>\n        <li>✓ Sync across 2 devices</li>\n        <li>✓ Community support</li>\n        <li class=\"muted\">✗ Version history</li>\n        <li class=\"muted\">✗ Shared workspaces</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\" style=\"border:2px solid currentColor\">\n      <div class=\"between row\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Pro</h2><span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span></div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">For professionals who need power and flexibility.</p>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-value price\" data-m=\"12\" data-y=\"9.60\">$12</span> <span class=\"muted small per\">/ month</span></div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-block\" href=\"#signup-pro\">Start 14-day trial</a>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Cancel anytime during the trial.</p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n        <li>✓ Unlimited projects</li>\n        <li>✓ 100 GB file storage</li>\n        <li>✓ Unlimited devices</li>\n        <li>✓ 30-day version history</li>\n        <li>✓ Custom templates &amp; automations</li>\n        <li>✓ Priority email support</li>\n        <li class=\"muted\">✗ Shared workspaces</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"between row\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Team</h2><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">For teams</span></div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Collaborate securely with your whole team.</p>\n      <div><span class=\"stat-value price\" data-m=\"20\" data-y=\"16\">$20</span> <span class=\"muted small per\">/ user / month</span></div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\" href=\"#contact-sales\">Start team trial</a>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Minimum 3 users. <a href=\"#contact-sales\">Talk to sales</a></p>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n        <li>✓ Everything in Pro</li>\n        <li>✓ 1 TB pooled storage</li>\n        <li>✓ Shared workspaces &amp; permissions</li>\n        <li>✓ Unlimited version history</li>\n        <li>✓ SSO &amp; admin audit log</li>\n        <li>✓ Dedicated support, 99.9% SLA</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <h3 class=\"h4\">Compare plans</h3>\n    <table class=\"table\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Free</th><th>Pro</th><th>Team</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>Projects</td><td>3</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Storage</td><td class=\"num\">2 GB</td><td class=\"num\">100 GB</td><td class=\"num\">1 TB</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Devices</td><td class=\"num\">2</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Version history</td><td>—</td><td>30 days</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Shared workspaces</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✓</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>SSO &amp; audit log</td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✓</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Support</td><td>Community</td><td>Priority email</td><td>Dedicated</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"alert\">\n    <strong>Questions about billing?</strong> Prices are in USD and exclude tax. Switch or cancel plans anytime; changes are prorated. Non-profits and students get 50% off Pro. <a href=\"#contact-sales\">Contact us</a>.\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var m=document.getElementById('bill-monthly'), y=document.getElementById('bill-yearly');\n  function set(yearly){\n    m.className='btn btn-sm'+(yearly?' btn-outline':''); y.className='btn btn-sm'+(yearly?'':' btn-outline');\n    m.setAttribute('aria-pressed',!yearly); y.setAttribute('aria-pressed',yearly);\n    document.querySelectorAll('.price').forEach(function(p){\n      var v=yearly?p.dataset.y:p.dataset.m; p.text